Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Did you know that even the\Nhottest desert can\Nsometimes get a blanket of\Nsnow?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Deserts like the Sahara are\Nusually super warm and\Nsunny
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}with lots of hot sand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}as far as you can see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It's a bit like being at the\Nbeach but without the\Nocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}But here's something\Nsurprising: sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}even these hot places can\Nhave snow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Imagine waking up to see\Nthose rolling sand dunes\Nturned white and fluffy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}like a snow-covered hill in\Nwinter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.77,0:00:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It happens because deserts\Ncan get very cold at night
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}You see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}when the sun goes down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}the heat slips away into the\Nsky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}temperature drops low\Nenough for snow to form
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Snow in the desert doesn't\Nhappen every year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It's a special event that\Noccurs when cold air swoops\Nin at just the right time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It's like getting a surprise\Nvisit from a distant friend—it\Ndoesn't happen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}often
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}but when it does
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.26,0:00:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}it's really exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.31,0:00:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}So next time you're outside\Non a chilly day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.71,0:00:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}think about how some\Nplaces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}those that are hot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.59,0:00:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}can have a magical touch of\Nsnow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.49,0:00:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}The world can be full of\Nsurprises
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}even in the most unlikely\Nplaces!
